<section class="section band has-ribbon ribbon--mixed">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">Questions</p>
      <h2>Before you book a call.</h2>
    </div>
    <details class="faq-item" open>
      <summary>Can I edit the site myself after launch?</summary>
      <div class="faq-answer">Yes. Pages are built from documented components, and you get a walkthrough plus the source files. If you prefer a CMS, the Growth plan includes a blog and page editor.</div>
    </details>
    <details class="faq-item">
      <summary>Do you design in Figma?</summary>
      <div class="faq-answer">Design happens in the browser wherever possible, so what you approve is what ships. Static files and component notes are provided for your records.</div>
    </details>
    <details class="faq-item">
      <summary>What if I only need a design, not a build?</summary>
      <div class="faq-answer">That works for teams with an in-house developer. The scope and price change, but the design system deliverables stay the same.</div>
    </details>
  </div>
</section>

